flowchart TB
  Policy[Policy and external authority]
  Control[Router / Director / Orchestrator]
  Work[Planner / Specialist / Integrator]
  Action[Tool / Provider / Native host]
  Proof[Verification / Reviewer / Assurance]
  Records[State / Artifact / Evidence / Telemetry]
  Policy --> Control
  Control --> Work
  Work --> Action
  Action --> Proof
  Proof --> Records
  Records -. feedback .-> Control
  Policy -. constraints .-> Proof
